<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank interim net up 24.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank interim net up 24.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   211.8  vs 170.7 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    40.0   vs 33.3 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    409.77 vs 330.30</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Lung Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 26 to October 4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 4</p>
<p>NOTE - A banking and financial services company.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and interim dividend have been adjusted for the capitalisation issue in April 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
